<title>USA: Alltrista to close Jackson, Miss. plant.</title>
<headline>Alltrista to close Jackson, Miss. plant.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alltrista Corp said on Tuesday it would close its Jackson, Tennessee, canning jar closure manufacturing operations, laying off about 50 people.</p>
<p>The closure is part of a consolidaiton of the operations at the consumer products maker's Muncie, Indiana plant, the company said.</p>
<p>The consolidaiton is not expected to result in a material charge to earnings, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
